(cherry picked from commit 15e066a3cc7484e59f1e1c26d651947c98cf42dd noble:linux-nvidia-6.11)
Signed-off-by: Jacob Martin <jacob.martin@canonical.com>

(cherry picked from commit 8fcaed8d5824 noble:linux-nvidia-6.14)
Signed-off-by: Abdur Rahman <abdur.rahman@canonical.com>

(cherry picked from commit ef306c832155a7f6555dcc428e995f54b5bab4a1 noble:linux-nvidia-6.17)
